```Time analysis: watch denies and TLS failures per hour for the apps in the current wave - the go/no-go panel during cut-over.```
index=proxy sourcetype=proxy:csv earliest=-7d
| lookup app_inventory domain AS dest OUTPUT app migration_wave
| search migration_wave=1
| eval outcome=case(ssl_result="handshake_failed","tls_failure", action="blocked","policy_deny", status>=500,"upstream_error", true(),"ok")
| timechart span=1h count BY outcome
